			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・通常時
※swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T06:31:03" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>MAN3</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T06:28:44" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c02r0601_man3_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>えっ？
おとしもの……？▼
それ！　その　ハンカチ！
ぼくのだッ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T06:53:16" />
