				Time="2011-06-25T06:29:06" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>えっ？
落し物……？▼
それ！　その　ハンカチ！
ぼくのだッ！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-25T06:53:07" />
